flowchart TD
    %% Nodes
    StartPoint(開始)
    EndPoint(結束)
    ReceiveInformation(Request Information)
    ValidateInformation{驗證使用者登入資訊}
    ReturnError(返回錯誤訊息)
    ProduceOrderId(生成訂單ID)
    InsertOrder(寫入訂單資料)
    InsertOrderItems(寫入訂單項目資料)
    UpdateStock(更新庫存)
    SyncRedis(同步Redis)

    %% Edges
    StartPoint --> ReceiveInformation
    ReceiveInformation --> ValidateInformation
    ValidateInformation -->|驗證失敗| ReturnError
    ValidateInformation -->|驗證成功| ProduceOrderId
    ProduceOrderId --> InsertOrder
    InsertOrder --> InsertOrderItems
    InsertOrderItems --> UpdateStock
    UpdateStock --> SyncRedis
    ReturnError --> EndPoint
    SyncRedis --> EndPoint